cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated manuscript."
title: "Iron cost-offset model for heavy menstrual bleeding (HMB)"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible R/Python code for a pharmacoeconomic cost-offset model comparing
  bleeding reduction (prevention) with iron replacement in heavy menstrual bleeding,
  expressed as cost per milligram of iron.
type: software
